{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Elfie: A Sand Plan</i> is a cute and relaxing geometric puzzle game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet Elfie, a small rotund elephant. She has quite a few sandcastle ideas in mind but she needs your help to build them! Using her perspective-based instructions, place the right sand blocks in the correct spots to match her vision. And with no predetermined solutions, you can take your time and enjoy solving each puzzle in the way you like!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784760/extras/dabe6a0cfd46a581692f01e8693702b5.poster.avif?t=1773355584\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784760/extras/dabe6a0cfd46a581692f01e8693702b5.webm?t=1773355584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features\u00a0\ud83c\udfd6\ufe0f</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Simple controls</i></strong>: Whether you are using a mouse or a touchscreen, the controls require only simple movements and inputs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Simple mechanics</i></strong>: Intuitive gameplay that is easy to understand just by playing a few early levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Creative Mode</i></strong>: Get through enough levels to unlock a mode where you will be able to use all the blocks to create your own sand castle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Outfits</i></strong>: Elfie is a stylish elephant! Unlock over 20 swimsuits for her as you progress to the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Music</strong>:<strong>\u00a0</strong></i>Unlock and enjoy original compositions that are perfect for relaxing while at the beach with Elfie!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>More Challenge:</i></strong>\u00a0For those looking to put their 3D visualization skills to the test, the\u00a0<i>&quot;Colorless Hints&quot;</i> and <i>&quot;No Hint&quot;</i> Modes are for you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Cozy Summer Vibes</i></strong>: With cute music and colorful aesthetic, let it immerse you in a perfect beach day!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Educational</i></strong>: Shapes and perspective puzzles perfectly suited for younger players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Elfie</i></strong>: She's so cute. A feature in itself!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784760/extras/e6422c32386857bd34f58d680c193d80.poster.avif?t=1773355584\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784760/extras/e6422c32386857bd34f58d680c193d80.webm?t=1773355584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784760/extras/e6422c32386857bd34f58d680c193d80.mp4?t=1773355584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dev Team &amp; About</strong> \ud83d\udcbb<strong>\ud83d\udc18</strong>\ud83c\udfbc<strong>\ud83d\udc18\ud83d\udca8</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! Pressed Elephant is a small team of 2 composed of a developer and a music composer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are currently working on Elfie and A Sand Plan was a minigame created as part of Elfie's minigame collection. As development progressed (and with some scope creep), we decided to have a standalone version for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy this cute puzzle game and introduction to our little friend's world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><pictur