perfectly suited for younger players!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Elfie</i></strong>: She's so cute. A feature in itself!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784760/extras/e6422c32386857bd34f58d680c193d80.poster.avif?t=1773355584\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784760/extras/e6422c32386857bd34f58d680c193d80.webm?t=1773355584\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784760/extras/e6422c32386857bd34f58d680c193d80.mp4?t=1773355584\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dev Team &amp; About</strong> \ud83d\udcbb<strong>\ud83d\udc18</strong>\ud83c\udfbc<strong>\ud83d\udc18\ud83d\udca8</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello! Pressed Elephant is a small team of 2 composed of a developer and a music composer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are currently working on Elfie and A Sand Plan was a minigame created as part of Elfie's minigame collection. As development progressed (and with some scope creep), we decided to have a standalone version for it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We hope you enjoy this cute puzzle game and introduction to our little friend's world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784760/extras/331a5f1066706fc1572c76220f222988.apng?t=1773355584\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3784760/extras/331a5f1066706fc1572c76220f222988.poster.avif?t=1773355584\" class=\"bb_img\" width=1080 height=160 /></picture></span></p>","developers":["Pressed Elephant","Sol's Atelier"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","